    "title": "\"Been so long, but it's amazing.\" Family reunites with dog years after losing him - NewsBreak",
    "text": "WDBJ7.com\nwebsite\nRadford\n“Been so long, but it’s amazing.” Family reunites with dog years after losing him\nBy Lindsey Cook,\n4 hours agoRADFORD, Va. (WDBJ) - After spending years in and out of local shelters, a local dog has reunited with his owners and is back in his own home. The Boyd family lost their beloved dog, Romeo, in 2021. It wasn’t until two weeks ago Emalee Boyd found out he was at the Radford Animal shelter, and after years of separation, the family is whole again.\n1",
